  "notes": "{生息地|せいそくち} is primarily used for animals. For plants, {自生地|じせいち} (native habitat) is also used.\n\nFORMS:\n- {生息|せいそく} (inhabiting, living) + {地|ち} (place)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {生息|せいそく}する: to inhabit, to live (animals)\n- {自生地|じせいち}: native habitat (plants)\n- {棲息|せいそく}: alternative writing, same meaning\n- {環境|かんきょう}: environment\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {生息地|せいそくち}の{保護|ほご}: habitat protection\n- {生息地|せいそくち}の{破壊|はかい}: habitat destruction\n- {生息地|せいそくち}が{脅|おびや}かされる: habitat is threatened",
